"Returns the unique set of tissue/organ names used as top-level groupings "
"(e.g. 'Breast', 'Lung', 'Brain/CNS', 'Bladder/Urinary Tract'). Use to "
"discover what tissues are represented in OncoTree before searching by "
"tissue, or to enumerate all supported cancer tissue origins."
msgstr ""

