#: ../../tools/oncotree_tools.rst:95 b2b388dc17644e04b3c067c2481a8ddd
msgid "**Type**: ``OncoTreeSearchTool``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/oncotree_tools.rst:96 0e8b9b37d8e84356b71a5c31c883bf87
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the OncoTree cancer type ontology by name, code, "
"main type, or tissue. OncoTree is a hierarchical cancer classification "
"system developed at Memorial Sloan Kettering with 897+ cancer types. "
"Returns standardized cancer type codes with UMLS and NCI Thesaurus cross-"
"references. Use to identify the correct OncoTree code for a cancer type, "
"find all cancer subtypes under a tissue, or map free-text cancer names to"
" structured identifiers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/oncotree_tools.rst:100 86aed96c3209415ca6fe51c40477cdb4
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (required) Search term. Interpreted according to the "
"'field' parameter. Examples: 'breast cancer', 'BRCA', 'Lung', 'Non-Small "
"Cell Lung Cancer'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/oncotree_tools.rst:103 d24dba061d5f470580eb70f285acc920
msgid ""
"``field`` (string) (optional) Field to search in. One of: 'name' (cancer "
"type name), 'code' (OncoTree code), 'main\\_type' (main cancer category),"
" 'tissue' (tissue of origin). Default: 'name'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/oncotree_tools.rst:106 7430ba9deb0043bd8dc0c6fe5032386a
msgid ""
"``exact_match`` (boolean) (optional) If true, requires exact match. If "
"false (default), performs substring/prefix matching."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/oncotree_tools.rst:109 b366e90b2b1540c5a72a5bd34bc0d68b
msgid ""
"``version`` (string) (optional) OncoTree version identifier. Use "
"'oncotree\\_latest\\_stable' (default) for the current production "
"version."
msgstr ""

